#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Fins a quin punt ha de coincidir la vostra cara i si l'Ubuntu Hello us "
"demana que confirmeu que hi sou realment."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Rigor de la coincidència facial"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
